WEBVTT

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:05.370
Won't leave

00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:11.040
Without a dropkick on her

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.210
Zazas Zazas Nasatanada Zazas

00:00:28.010 --> 00:00:32.230
-She summoned me, the evil god
-Evil god

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:34.770
-I gotta kill her or else
-What?

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.650
-I can't go back to hell
-Sister...

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.360
Yeah, yeah, yeah
Life next to death, I combat with my chainsaw

00:00:40.570 --> 00:00:42.240
If you go too far

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:46.240
I'll slice you up completely

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:48.620
Your halo
Must get it back

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:52.660
-Never miss a chance
-Hey, seriously?

00:00:52.870 --> 00:00:56.960
-To attack her from behind
-You're so mean

00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:01.090
I'll never give up

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:02.840
Yurine, you're off your guard!

00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:06.930
Now!
Time to finish you with the Royal Copenhagen!

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.850
Huh? What? I missed...

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.270
Can't leave Earth

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:18.360
Without a dropkick on her

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:21.530
But until then

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:27.490
-Let's all have fun together
-Yeah!

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.580
Take this, Yurine!

00:01:35.620 --> 00:01:41.460
Here's my grand entrance dropkick
to start off the final episode!

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.420
Even though
you'll probably dodge it.

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:51.720
I got her...

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:55.190
That hurt.

00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:58.230
An eye for an eye.

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:04.240
I missed.

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:07.030
Oh, well, I forgive you.

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.990
Just get dinner ready, okay?

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:14.330
She never misses...

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:18.880
Tonight's dinner
is twice-cooked pork!

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:22.800
The cabbage and pork belly
were a steal today.

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:26.130
Delicious!

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:29.300
You like twice-cooked pork, right?

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.060
Yurine?

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.730
Yeah, I do.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:38.940
You make it really good too.

00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:43.070
But it seems like your appetite
is shot.

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:45.360
I'm already full.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:50.620
I'm gonna go lie down for a bit.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:55.330
She left so much.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:58.000
Was it the cheap pork belly?

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:02.790
That can't be. I prepared it
so you couldn't even tell.

00:03:03.170 --> 00:03:04.550
Yup, it's delicious.

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:08.550
Something's wrong.
Yurine never leaves leftovers.

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:13.010
Yurine, are you okay?

00:03:13.350 --> 00:03:15.100
Do you have a fever?

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.180
You're burning up!

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.190
Where's the thermometer?

00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:25.150
102 degrees?

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:28.450
Isn't that really high for humans?

00:03:29.110 --> 00:03:31.110
Blankets! Blankets!

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:34.080
Lie down here.
Oh, yeah, water-filled pillows!

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:37.700
Put it under your head!

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:40.000
Time to change into pajamas!

00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:45.420
Now we need medicine
to lower her fever...

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:48.800
Which, we don't have.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.130
This should help for now.

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:54.140
Good, now she's rested.

00:03:54.680 --> 00:03:56.310
What the hell am I doing?

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:59.770
Why am I taking care of her?

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:05.070
She's the very reason
I can't go back to Hell.

00:04:12.070 --> 00:04:15.780
She summoned me without knowing
the return spell.

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:19.950
In order for me to return,
she has to die.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:23.210
I'm an idiot.

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:28.000
This is my prime opportunity
to kill her while she's weak!

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:29.340
Jashin-chan...

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:32.340
Water...

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:34.260
Not my problem.

00:04:34.430 --> 00:04:36.850
Go get it yourself.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:45.400
She's halfway there.
I might as well leave her to die.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:48.320
Finally!

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:51.570
My long struggle
is about to come to an end!

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:55.410
Now, why don't I go celebrate
before my victorious return?

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:59.910
Didn't even need to end
her life myself.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:01.540
Good-bye Yurine.

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.920
Living in the human world
wasn't all that bad.

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.170
I finally get to go home!

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.800
I'll be at the arcade until closing

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:19.100
and eat my last curry
on the way back.

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.810
Yurine will have to be dead by then!

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:29.360
We'll...

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:33.240
never meet again...

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:41.620
I'm cold...

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.620
What do you guys think?

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:46.330
She looks miserable,
her fever's too high.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.380
She needs to see a doctor now.

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:50.840
Yeah, I'll go get the car.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:53.090
Jashin-chan, carry her down.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:54.970
You bet!

00:05:55.260 --> 00:05:57.010
Medusa, you get the bill!

00:05:57.470 --> 00:05:59.390
Beth, you just stay home!

00:06:00.970 --> 00:06:03.770
-By car, did you mean this?
-Yeah!

00:06:04.140 --> 00:06:07.150
Trust me, this is the best way
to get around

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:09.310
Jinbocho's narrow streets.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.270
Oh, okay.

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.650
Hold on tight!

00:06:17.780 --> 00:06:20.410
Obey the speed limit, Minos!

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:24.410
Go, go, go!

00:06:25.580 --> 00:06:26.710
She took her meds.

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:28.000
She'll recover now.

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:31.460
The doctor said
she'll be better in a couple days.

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:33.550
What a relief.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:37.340
Never expected you'd save Yurine,
Jashin-chan.

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:39.590
See? I told you.

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:42.060
Jashin-chan's generous at heart.

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:45.680
Shut up! I'm the devil,
I'll knock you out!

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:52.150
If something happened to Yurine
because of my neglect,

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:55.570
you guys would've shunned me.

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:58.740
I do want to go home.

00:06:59.030 --> 00:07:00.450
But...

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.950
I don't want to lose
you guys either.

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:08.290
Yeah, right.

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:11.080
You were genuinely concerned
for Yurine.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.380
One more word
and I'll turn you into steak!

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:17.470
You better not get all cocky either,
Medusa.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:21.680
-All I want is your money, not you!
-Sure, sure.

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.560
Damn it, you better listen!

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:27.930
Hey, quiet down.
You're gonna wake Yurine.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:30.520
-Oh, yeah.
-I'm sorry.

00:07:31.690 --> 00:07:35.280
We're out of here.
Take good care of her, okay?

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:37.650
Thanks for your help.

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:44.160
Now...

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:50.500
Let's practice good bedside manners.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:54.420
I'll stand by her pillow
and look out for her until dawn.

00:07:55.040 --> 00:07:57.760
I'll sing her a lullaby too.

00:07:57.920 --> 00:08:02.840
The bookstore we went to
Together that day

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:08.680
Turned into a convenience store
Before we knew it

00:08:09.890 --> 00:08:15.190
That curry shop where I got stood up

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:20.820
Still serves baked potato
With their curry

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:24.910
You're just an insignificant bug

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.740
And I'm your freeloader

00:08:27.910 --> 00:08:31.160
We share a 100-square-foot room

00:08:31.330 --> 00:08:34.380
That's completely crammed with books

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:42.380
You seemed to be really happy

00:08:43.050 --> 00:08:48.680
But I was always paranoid
About the floors falling through

00:08:48.850 --> 00:08:51.810
Jinbocho

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:54.770
What a life we lived

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:57.820
Jinbocho

00:08:57.980 --> 00:09:01.990
Those youthful days are now

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:05.910
Long gone

00:09:06.450 --> 00:09:08.240
What's with that song?

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:09.870
Sorry I woke you.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:12.460
It's a song I wrote myself.

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:15.000
"Jinbocho Elegy."

00:09:15.170 --> 00:09:17.380
There are six verses to it!

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:19.050
Who do you think you are?

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:22.720
What? It's quite the masterpiece,
isn't it?

00:09:23.050 --> 00:09:25.010
You woke me up.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.100
Don't be a dick!

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:30.680
By the sixth verse
of "Jinbocho Elegy,"

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:34.690
we fly away together on a balloon
out into the universe.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:39.770
Now I'm intrigued.

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:41.820
Then let's continue!

00:09:41.990 --> 00:09:43.820
Please don't.

00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:45.860
Jashin-chan...

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.240
Thank you.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:56.460
Minos took you to the hospital
and Medusa took care of the bill.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.330
So thank them.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:02.090
I didn't care that you were sick
at all.

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:06.430
I'm hungry all of a sudden.

00:10:06.590 --> 00:10:07.930
Make me something.

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.930
You're so dependent on me.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:13.890
Why don't I make some gruel
with ginger to blast that cold away?

00:10:14.270 --> 00:10:17.650
Wait, she has an appetite!
She's recovering quick!

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:22.400
Shit. She's gonna retaliate
against me.

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:25.450
I'm not doing anything.

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:27.240
Cool.

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:29.910
Drink, but do not drink away
your reason.

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:32.870
Catch a cold, but do not--

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:36.160
Hey, Yurine.

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:38.460
Do you know about the Ryounkaku?

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:39.880
Ryounkaku?

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:44.960
My friend in Hell is telling me
to go see the Ryounkaku in Asakusa.

00:10:45.130 --> 00:10:48.680
It's a big, tall building
and a great tourist attraction.

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:51.550
Sounds familiar.

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:54.600
You're talking about this.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:55.980
The Ryounkaku.

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:59.350
The first building to have
electric elevators in Japan.

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:03.360
It was demolished due to damages
from the Great Kanto earthquake.

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:04.820
What a shame.

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:06.740
Now that I think about it,

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:10.530
she did mention she visited
the human world 100 years ago.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:12.080
Could you keep it down?

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:14.540
Go to Oshiage instead.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:17.160
I already did with Medusa.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:19.370
What? I've never been.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:21.580
I've never been!

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:23.420
Me neither.

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:26.510
We tend to overlook
local touristy things, right?

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:28.880
It's true. Believe it or not,

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:32.390
-I've never been to the Tokyo Tower.
-See?

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:35.600
Well, aren't you such
a Tokyo devil now?

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:38.980
But that's too bad
about the Ryounkaku.

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:42.190
I was 100 years too late.

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:44.730
I envy you guys.

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:48.650
You guys easily live past 100 years.

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:52.740
If I could live thousands of years
like you guys,

00:11:52.910 --> 00:11:56.830
I could witness more
historically-significant events.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.080
Help me...

00:11:58.250 --> 00:12:04.000
Humans are limited to witnessing
only 70 to 80 years of history.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:08.300
I know I'll be gone in 100 years.

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:12.720
If peace continues
to thrive in the world,

00:12:12.890 --> 00:12:15.560
I'd like to live
a couple hundred years

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:19.020
to witness the transformation.

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:22.810
You guys are able to do that.

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:25.360
I guess so.

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:30.610
It seems like nothing to us,
but it's a big deal for humans.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:35.200
I'm curious about the future
of this world too.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:39.200
Sure, humans live a short time
but their legacy gets passed on

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:42.210
and that's what shapes
the present world, right?

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:44.380
That's fascinating!

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.040
Your life is short but meaningful.

00:12:47.210 --> 00:12:49.840
Makes living thousands of years
look lazy.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:55.680
That's why I like
and respect humans.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:58.890
Sure, humans are destructive,
but beyond that,

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:02.810
they have the power to imagine
many great things.

00:13:02.980 --> 00:13:04.850
I still despise humans.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:06.400
Jashin-chan!

00:13:06.560 --> 00:13:08.730
But, I do like the human world.

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:11.780
Lots of fun things to do.

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:15.160
Lots of delicious food to eat!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.740
It all comes down to that, huh?

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:21.290
I got hungry just thinking that.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.500
Jeez.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:25.040
Let's go eat!

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:28.500
Medusa, how about
expensive yakiniku? What do you say?

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:31.380
-I can't say no to you.
-Score!

00:13:31.550 --> 00:13:34.680
Don't be a mooch.
I'll pitch in too, Medusa.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.800
Hey, I wanna join you guys too!

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.680
-Don't be a mooch, Minos.
-Look who's talking!

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:43.230
Shut up! You want my dropkick?

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:45.690
I'll attack you back, no problem.

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:48.520
Don't make a scene
at the restaurant, please.

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:57.530
Flower viewing? I'm not going.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:58.740
Why not?

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:04.000
I'm an angel. I refuse to picnic
amongst you devils.

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:06.750
Don't be a downer,
aren't we friends?

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:10.210
No, since when?

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:13.590
We prepared food for you too.

00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:15.630
Food...?

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:18.970
What kind of food?

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:20.260
Let's see...

00:14:20.430 --> 00:14:23.720
We've got yakitori,
sushi and sandwiches.

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.610
This is a prime spot.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:39.240
How long have you
been claiming this spot?

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.910
Why aren't you answering?

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:44.540
Oh, hey.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:48.710
Jashin-chan was here for 66 hours.

00:14:48.870 --> 00:14:50.540
Sixty-six hours?

00:14:51.090 --> 00:14:56.130
She was punished for hiding
a half-eaten sandwich in my desk.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.340
Saving it for later!

00:14:58.630 --> 00:15:02.260
I banned her from having
the smartphone,

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:05.100
games, and books for 66 hours.

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.850
You're relentless.

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.560
Cheers!

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:10.690
Cheers.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:16.280
Drinks under the cherry blossoms,
how elegant. I love Japan!

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:19.820
You're such a tourist, Minos.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:21.870
Hey, you guys!

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:23.990
You're too young to drink!

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:27.580
Oh, it's Orochimaru!

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:34.840
We must be destined for each other.

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:37.880
Stop! Don't do this to me!

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:43.850
Besides Yurine, the fallen angel
and devils here are all of age!

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:45.680
I'm not a fallen angel.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:49.350
I'm at least a hundred times older
than you, Mei.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:51.980
You called me Mei!

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:54.360
We're getting so intimate!

00:15:54.610 --> 00:15:59.740
Let's recognize this day
as "Mei Orochimaru Day" forever!

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:02.620
Let's celebrate with a drink!

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:04.200
Aren't you on the clock?

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:07.620
It's fine, this job
isn't too serious.

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:14.710
There's a dead body buried
under the cherry blossom tree.

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:17.340
May they rest in peace.

00:16:20.930 --> 00:16:23.260
I don't really want to do this job.

00:16:23.430 --> 00:16:25.550
I chose it for its stability

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:28.680
but I end up getting scorned
every day.

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:31.730
She's such a downer.

00:16:31.890 --> 00:16:35.230
Go and abandon her somewhere.

00:16:35.560 --> 00:16:37.360
Now!

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:42.030
Why don't we go for a walk?

00:16:42.740 --> 00:16:44.370
That sounds so tough.

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:46.660
You must be so stressed.

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:50.000
All right, it's time to party!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.210
How about some meat buns?

00:16:52.370 --> 00:16:53.960
That sounds great!

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:56.460
-I'd like some!
-Of course.

00:16:56.630 --> 00:16:59.300
-Oh, hey, Noel.
-Damn it, not again.

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:01.260
Isn't that Poporon?

00:17:01.420 --> 00:17:02.840
Pekola too?

00:17:03.010 --> 00:17:05.340
Is she your friend, Pekola?

00:17:05.510 --> 00:17:09.600
Damn it, Noel. So you are Poporon!

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:13.310
Hey, Noel,
it's time for your break.

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:15.860
Boss.

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:18.190
-Hey there, Yurine.
-Hello.

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:22.950
Noel's a good girl.
Hope you guys get along.

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:27.370
A good girl?

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:31.830
-Why don't you join us?
-You're Pekola's friend, right?

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:35.710
Right?

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.590
None of your business.

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.920
Poporon, don't be so rude.

00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:43.340
Shut up!

00:17:43.510 --> 00:17:46.340
How could you befriend
humans and devils?

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:48.350
Stop being an ass!

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:51.600
I'll set you straight.
Let's go outside!

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:53.390
We are outside!

00:17:53.560 --> 00:17:55.690
Quit it, Jashin-chan.

00:17:56.190 --> 00:17:58.730
Sorry for pressuring you.

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:00.440
Maybe next time.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:03.990
Goodbye.

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:06.240
Damn it, Noel!

00:18:06.410 --> 00:18:07.950
She's a thorny one.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:10.580
She used to be my subordinate.

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:13.700
But she is a bit corrupt
for an angel.

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:17.080
She wasn't like that before.

00:18:18.580 --> 00:18:20.000
Who cares?

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:21.960
Let's drink and sing it away!

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:27.050
Cherry blossoms, cherry blossoms

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:31.680
In fields, mountains, and villages

00:18:31.930 --> 00:18:36.020
As far as you can go

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:41.190
Is it mist or clouds?

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:44.820
Jeez, what a joke.

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:47.570
Yeah!

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:50.990
And then, and then...

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:54.370
They all bully and call me
the strange girl.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:56.660
That's so mean.

00:18:56.910 --> 00:19:00.920
They must've forgotten about me
by now...

00:19:01.130 --> 00:19:04.000
MEI OROCHIMARU DAY

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:11.220
I'm feeling the withdrawals
of zero recent devil activity.

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:16.640
How about bread for lunch?

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.770
I'm in the mood for a rice dish.

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:23.270
Really? It's about time
you craved bread.

00:19:23.440 --> 00:19:25.030
Well, I don't.

00:19:25.190 --> 00:19:26.320
-I want--
-No.

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:28.860
You look like you want bread.

00:19:29.700 --> 00:19:31.450
-Yes.
-See?

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:35.240
It seemed like you could kill
for some bread.

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:40.250
I love the smell of a bakery.

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:42.380
The pleasant smell of yeast.

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:46.590
This fresh bread looks great.

00:19:47.170 --> 00:19:50.090
Delicious!
Maybe I should get that one.

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:54.260
But this one looks good too.

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:57.350
Did you just...?

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:59.850
It said "Please help yourself."

00:20:00.020 --> 00:20:02.980
What kind of person
hogs all the samples?

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:05.110
But I'm not a person.

00:20:05.360 --> 00:20:06.400
I'm a devil.

00:20:09.740 --> 00:20:13.740
I'll take some bread
and tear it into pieces...

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:16.290
Stab it with some toothpicks...

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:18.330
Voila, just like new!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:20.910
You think you're so clever!

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:23.960
You just tore apart
a perfect piece of bread!

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:27.710
You'd better apologize
and pay for it.

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:29.210
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:32.760 --> 00:20:38.350
I'll switch the ham roll's label
with the choco-cornet's!

00:20:39.140 --> 00:20:44.440
That'll stump everyone.
They'll look so dumb!

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:52.610
Why are you so mischievous today?

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:58.450
Maybe you just don't notice
that I'm mischievous every day?

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:05.210
Blame my devilish instincts!
I get an itch to be bad at times.

00:21:05.540 --> 00:21:09.960
Medusa and Minos are devils too
and they're not bad at all.

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:12.800
That's their distinct personalities.

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:16.050
You're so full of shit.

00:21:16.350 --> 00:21:18.010
My balloon...

00:21:18.350 --> 00:21:21.060
Mom, could you get it?

00:21:21.350 --> 00:21:24.140
It went way too far up.

00:21:25.900 --> 00:21:28.820
-You can redeem yourself.
-How?

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:30.570
Get the balloon for them.

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:32.070
No way.

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:35.160
-I don't help humans.
-What a shame.

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:40.450
Wouldn't it be a piece of cake
for you to get that balloon?

00:21:40.620 --> 00:21:43.960
Well, that's totally true.

00:21:44.120 --> 00:21:46.210
All right, I'll help.

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:48.790
Flatter a devil to get your way.

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:53.670
There. Here's your balloon, kiddo.

00:21:56.640 --> 00:22:00.930
Whoa, what's happening?
How could you hold this thing?

00:22:02.810 --> 00:22:03.930
Are you kidding me?

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:09.610
That's Jashin-chan!

00:22:10.230 --> 00:22:14.360
I finally found you!
Wait up, Jashin-chan!

00:22:25.210 --> 00:22:28.880
Dropkick on her, yeah her
I'll take you down again

00:22:29.040 --> 00:22:33.800
Hate you
Love doesn't exist in this world

00:22:34.550 --> 00:22:39.090
Fear the dropkick
An angel looks for her halo

00:22:39.260 --> 00:22:43.520
As she starves to death

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:45.980
It's a love and hate relationship

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:48.270
Can't leave each other alone

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:52.900
Like a galaxy-bursting shooting star

00:22:53.110 --> 00:22:57.110
Slowly, slowly, sneak up and die

00:22:57.360 --> 00:22:59.530
Test my heart, don't stop

00:22:59.740 --> 00:23:06.620
Let's go, dream on
No matter human, angel or devil

00:23:06.790 --> 00:23:11.000
We're a happy family

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:15.130
Let me say, I love you

00:23:15.380 --> 00:23:17.590
When all is said and done

00:23:17.880 --> 00:23:22.180
I'm home
Welcome back, it's hot pot tonight

00:23:22.550 --> 00:23:26.680
Come, gather everyone
Let's enjoy this meal

00:23:27.140 --> 00:23:28.940
For another crazy tomorrow

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:32.650
What next? What next?
In the end, wake up

00:23:32.820 --> 00:23:35.480
Until we meet again!

00:23:35.650 --> 00:23:39.530
Hasta la vista, baby.
